  "purpose": "First native Linux x86_64 verification (scripts/linux/run.sh) and the matching Windows run, both on HEAD 79073e9 plus the working tree committed with this evidence (Linux Clippy fix, recovery handoff de-duplication, agent probe wait, pty_clipboard.py).",
  "linux": "Debian 12 container under Docker Desktop (WSL2 kernel 6.6.87.2), rustc 1.98.1, 12 CPUs; Python pty + pyte, not a terminal emulator; clipboard through xclip on a private Xvfb display.",
