  "notes": [
    "Linux found three issues fixed with this evidence: a Unix-only collapsible_if Clippy error in clipboard.rs; duplicate recovered drafts after a crash between handoff commit and origin removal (pty_recovery ~1 in 10 runs); pty_agent mistaking the save lease's 'AI 1' for the analysis lease.",
    "A guinea-io unit test flake (locked session skipped while a parallel test spawned a child) was seen once under load and made robust; 5 repeated Linux workspace runs passed.",
    "Not covered: macOS, ARM, real Linux terminal emulators, Wayland clipboard, SSH/tmux."
